{"type":"item.completed","item":{"id":"item_4","type":"command_execution","command":"/opt/homebrew/bin/zsh -lc \"rg -n '\"'^## |''^### |7'\"\\\\.3|Authority and scope' AGENTS.md\"","aggregated_output":"9:## Where to look first\n27:## Authority and scope\n39:  work, as one recommendation and one test (§7.3). Settle wording, placement and where a rule is written yourself, and say so in the\n59:## 1. Before acting on a failure: diagnose\n91:## 2. Before writing code: design\n122:## 3. Writing code\n145:## 4. Tests\n168:## 5. Verification\n194:## 6. Writing prompts\n237:## 7. Measuring and iterating\n239:### 7.1 The ruler\n292:### 7.2 Reading results\n326:### 7.3 Iterating\n366:  options and a recommendation, Authority and scope) (Alex, 2026-11-04: \"就测试一种，一次 … 你就没有自己看5轮review，能不能自己有个超级自信的定论和证据再给我提建议？\").\n388:## 8. Product thinking\n419:## 9. Workspace and operations\n428:  allows (§7.3) starts only on his explicit word (Alex, 2026-10-27: \"我不是要你看下step 1抽取到底行不行？\").\n449:## 10. Rebuilding from ../tn-hivemind\n456:## 11. Design documents and decisions\n485:## Before finishing a slice\n","exit_code":0,"status":"completed"}}
