ust be linked or control, draw 1, 2 or 3')\n310:               'reader days': run.reader_days, 'retired rows': len(retired), 'stopped': ''}\n318:        summary['stopped'] = f'{type(error).__name__}: {error}'[:500]\n320:            run.terminal = {'outcome': 'infrastructure stop', 'reason': summary['stopped']}\n362:def acceptance(summary, pinned, kind):\n366:        'window completed, no stop': summary['stopped'] == '' and summary['terminal'] == {'outcome': 'complete'},\n376:        'ledger clean (not stopped, no overrun)': not (summary.get('ledger') or {}).get('stopped') and not (summary.get('ledger') or {}).get('overrun'),\n381:def refusing_judge(label, refuse, twice=False):\n386:    def answer(provider, request):\n400:def dry(out, kind, draw, refuse=(), twice=False):\n405:    print(json.dumps({'sequence': f'{kind}-{draw}', 'terminal': summary['terminal'], 'stopped': summary['stopped'][:200],\n411:def send(out, kind, draw, ledger_path, approved):\n414:        raise SystemExit('the approved ceiling must be a finite amount above 0 (and within the harness limit)')\n418:        raise SystemExit(f'the ledger ceiling {ceiling!r} is not the approved ${approved}: refused')\n422:        raise SystemExit(f'another launch of {label} is running')\n425:        summary = run_sequence(out, kind, draw, budget.BudgetTransport(ledger), ledger.read, 'paid')\n428:    print(json.dumps({'sequence': label, 'terminal': summary['terminal'], 'stopped': summary['stopped'][:300],\n450:        raise SystemExit(f'unknown command {command}')\ndocs/research/2026-11-20-production-readiness/dependency-design/DESIGN.md:1:# Linking related questions: the build design, version 5 (D694, D695; for council review before code)\ndocs/research/2026-11-20-production-readiness/dependency-design/DESIGN.md:3:Alex chose A (D694) and narrowed the first version (D695, \"只连数字题\"): a link joins a **newly opened number question** and an **open\ndocs/research/2026-11-20-production-readiness/dependency-design/DESIGN.m